[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15901.59, "timestamp": "04:25:01", "text": "それを試してみて。ほら、あのクラブのことだよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15905.429, "timestamp": "04:25:05", "text": "音楽ですよね？ダンスミュージック"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15909.189, "timestamp": "04:25:09", "text": "彼らが演奏するベースミュージックのように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15911.91, "timestamp": "04:25:11", "text": "クラブ。ええ、そういうことだと思います"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15916.229, "timestamp": "04:25:16", "text": "ジャンル。はい。それはEDMの曲です。そこには"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15919.189, "timestamp": "04:25:19", "text": "サブジャンルとかが本当にたくさんある。私の音楽"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15921.51, "timestamp": "04:25:21", "text": "制作クラスでは、EDMについて教えています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15925.75, "timestamp": "04:25:25", "text": "などなど。そうなんです、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15928.95, "timestamp": "04:25:28", "text": "それはすばらしい。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15931.385, "timestamp": "04:25:31", "author": "@site36.official", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Oc0kgq4lSUaD-BoDbaDE3pXUquuz47c4Yh7kwPILHO2D70EQ5EnEgoGgTbb5gw993EEXRqCx_A=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I learnt it yesterday that you were an EDM fan and I kinda spent the entire night figuring it out 🥹"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15932.389, "timestamp": "04:25:32", "text": "私はまだその代金を支払わなければならない。えーと授業"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15934.149, "timestamp": "04:25:34", "text": "まだ保留中です。私は支払わなければならない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15935.149, "timestamp": "04:25:35", "text": "の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15942.95, "timestamp": "04:25:42", "text": "もの。待って、昨日習ったよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15945.269, "timestamp": "04:25:45", "text": "あなたがEDMファンだったこと。私はある意味"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15947.349, "timestamp": "04:25:47", "text": "一晩中、それを解明しようとしていた。待って、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15950.389, "timestamp": "04:25:50", "text": "私は自分がEDMファンだと公言したことは一度もありません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15953.269, "timestamp": "04:25:53", "text": "以前はそう言っていた。待って、それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15956.87, "timestamp": "04:25:56", "text": "ファンダム、ミッキー。私は信じている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15959.99, "timestamp": "04:25:59", "text": "彼はEDMファンだ。あなたはただのEDMファンです"}]